# Architecture Rules

Architecture: Clean Modular Monolith.

Layers:

Domain
Application
Infrastructure
Interfaces
Support

Controllers must contain no business logic.

Flow:

Controller → Service → Action → Repository → Model

Repositories handle database queries.

Domain layer must not depend on Infrastructure.

Services orchestrate business operations.

DTO objects must be used between layers.

Architecture must remain stable unless explicitly changed.
